        <reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>All configuration parameter changes in OKU and SKU SHALL be logged to a tamper-evident audit trail including: user ID, timestamp, previous value, new value. Audit logs SHALL be retained for ≥5 years.</reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>
