        <reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>All configurable parameters stored in OKU and SKU non-volatile memory SHALL be protected by a SHA-256 cryptographic hash. Any parameter modification SHALL invalidate the system until re-commissioning.</reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>
