        <reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>All safety-critical functions of the KAVACH system SHALL be implemented with a Tolerable Hazard Rate (THR) ≤10⁻⁹ per hour, meeting EN 50129 SIL4 requirements.</reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>
        <reqif-common:ATTRIBUTES>
          <reqif-common:ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <reqif-common:ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>ReqIF_CustomRequirementType</reqif-common:ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
