        <reqif-common:LAST-CHANGE>2026-06-09T20:24:52Z</reqif-common:LAST-CHANGE>
        <reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>The KAVACH system SHALL prevent rear-end collisions by supervising the following train's speed against a safe separation distance computed from the preceding train's last known position.</reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>
