            <reqif-common:ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>ReqIF_CustomPriority</reqif-common:ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
            <reqif-common:THE-VALUE>shall</reqif-common:THE-VALUE>
