        <reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>The Stationary KAVACH Unit (SKU) SHALL generate and transmit Movement Authorities to Onboard KAVACH Units (OKU) via UHF radio within 500ms of a signal aspect change.</reqif-common:DESCRIPTION>
